          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naga mundu akumlemwecesya mjakwe, nipo mundu jwakulemwajo akwima pasogolo pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi m'nyumba muno kuti alumbile naga yili yisyene kuti jwalakwejo nganalemwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wawo AMBUJE, kwinani kwali wawoko apikane, nipo ŵalamule ŵakutumicila ŵawo. Apelece cilango kwa mundu jwakulemwajo, nambo mundu jumkinalemwajo amsalile kuti nganakola magambo, nipo ampe mbote jakwe mwakulingana ni kulungamika kwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naga ŵandu ŵenu Aisalaeli akugomecedwa ni amagongo ŵawo ku ngondo ligongo lyakuti ŵalemwecesye wawo, nambo kaneko akwika kukwalambila wawo ni kuŵenda cikululucilo kwa wawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pelepo, apikanile kuŵenda kwawoko, nipo akululuce ulemwa wosope wa Aisalaeli ni kwawucisya ku cilambo ciŵapele jemanjajo pamo ni acinangolo ŵawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naga wawo akuwugala kwinani kuti ula jikagwa ligongo lyakuti ŵandu ŵalemwecesye wawo, nambo kaneko akupitikuka mitima jawo ni kwaŵenda wawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵapikanile jemanjaji ni kwakululucila ulemwa wawo ni kwajiganya kutenda yindu yakulungama. Kaneko atumisye ula ku cilambo cecino ciŵacipelece kuti ciŵe ca ŵandu ŵawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwine mwakwe mcilambo timuciŵa mwana cilala, yilwele yakulekanganalekangana, konasika kwa mbeju ligongo lya mbepo kapena sombe, kapena kuti amagongo ŵawo ŵasyungulile jemanjaji, kapena yilwele sikati ja jemanjajo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tukwaŵenda kuti apikane kuŵenda kwawoko. Naga mundu jwalijose akulitendela canasa msyene ni kupopela kwa wawo AMBUJE, Mlungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ampikane ni kumjanga mapopelo gakwe. Pakuŵapo wawojo ali Mlungu jwakusamanyilila nganisyo sya mu mtima mwa mundu jwalijose. Ajanje mapopelo ga mundu jwalijose pakukuya ndamo jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵanduwo tiŵacimbicisyeje ni kwapikanila wawo ndaŵi syosope, pakutama mcilamboci ciŵapelece wawo kwa acinangolo ŵawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŵandu ŵa yilambo yine pitacipikana ya ukulungwa wa wawo, ŵane mwa ŵanduwo taciyika kukupopela ni jemanjaji ku Nyumba jejino, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawo ŵapikane mapopelo gawo kwinani kwali wawoko ni kwatendela yaŵendileyo kuti ŵandu ŵa cilambo capasi cino amanyilile ni kwapikanila wawo mpela mwakusatendela Aisalaeli nipo amanyilile kuti Nyumba jindaŵileji jili jakwalambililamo wawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pandaŵi jakwawula ŵandu ŵenu kuputa ngondo ni amagongo ŵawo, naga akupopela aku alimkulola ku msinda awuno wele wawo ŵawusagwile, soni naga akulola ku Nyumba ajino jinataŵile wawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵajanje mapopelo gawo kutyocela kwinani kwali wawoko nipo ŵapundisye jemanjaji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mundu jwalijose akusalemwa, pakuti pangali mundu jwangalemwa, naga wawo awatumbilila jemanjaji ni kwaleka kuti alepele kwa amagongo ŵawo nipo ajigalidwe mpela acikapolo kwawula nawo ku yilambo yine, ŵajanje mapopelo gawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jali acikapolo ku cilambo ca cilendoco, naga akukumanyilila kulemwa kwawo, kaneko ni kugalawuka mitima jawo ni kupopela kwa wawo mwakulinandiya pakwiticisya ulemwa wawo, ŵajanje mapopelo gawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanduwo naga akugalawuka kusyesyene mtima mwawo ni kutanda kupopela ali alolite ku cilambo ciŵacipelece wawo kwa acinangolo ŵetu, ku msinda uŵawusagwile wawo, soni ku Nyumba ajino jinataŵile wawo AMBUJE, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wawo kwinani kwali wawoko ajanje mapopelo gawo, ni kwatendela canasa pa kwakululucila ulemwa wawo wosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wawo AMBUJE, atulole uwe ni kugapikana mapopelo getu m'nyumba ajino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE, Mlungu, ajinjile m'nyumba mwawo, mutuŵisile Libokosi lya Cilanga, cele cili cimanyisyo ca macili gawo, soni atameje m'nyumba muno mpaka kalakala. Ŵajaliwasye ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵawo, soni ŵakutumicila ŵawo asengweje ndaŵi syosope pa yambone ya wawo kuti aŵeje ŵakusangalala pa masengo gosope gakusatenda, ligongo lya umbone wa wawo AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.132.8+PSA.132.9+PSA.132.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mas 132:8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE akamtumbilila mwenye juŵamsagwile wawo. Akumbucile cinonyelo ciŵakwete pa jwakutumicila jwawo Daudi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
